  ok\ F.6.2.0855  C"
  ok
  okT{ : cq1 C" 123" ; -> }T
  okT{ cq1 COUNT SWAP C@ -> 3 CHAR 1 }T  Actual:Expected 31 =?= 31 3 =?= 3 
